  2027-12-17\, Lisbon\, Portugal\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-28\n
 Cutoff time unannounced: official deadline day only. Verify the organizer
 's submission portal.\nFormat: Paper-based\nOfficial source: https://cdc2
 027.ieeecss.org/authors/call-for-papers\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.git
